WEBVTT

00:01:58.239 --> 00:02:01.242
some with a history
of vaginal yeast infections

00:02:01.284 --> 00:02:02.785
and others without,

00:02:02.827 --> 00:02:06.122
a drink containing
a lot of sugar or glucose.

00:02:06.122 --> 00:02:10.751
Their blood and vaginal sugar levels
were measured before and after the drink.

00:02:10.793 --> 00:02:15.173
They found that the sugar levels
in the vaginal secretions didn't change

00:02:15.214 --> 00:02:16.382
for either group.

00:02:16.382 --> 00:02:17.800
But what about diabetes?

00:02:17.842 --> 00:02:20.386
Now we know diabetes is associated

00:02:20.386 --> 00:02:22.805
with an increased risk
of vaginal yeast infections,

00:02:22.847 --> 00:02:25.892
but the actual reason why isn't known.

00:02:25.892 --> 00:02:29.687
While very elevated glucose levels
might be part of it,

00:02:29.729 --> 00:02:32.565
it seems the immune system
and other factors